  <title>Sneltoetsen</title>

  <p>Using keyboard shortcuts can help speed up work-flow. In the table below
  is a list of shortcuts which can be used in <app>File Roller</app>.</p>

  <table frame="all" shade="rows">
    <tr>
      <td><p>Nieuw archief aanmaken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>N</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Een archief openen</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>O</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Een archief uitpakken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>E</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Archiefeigenschappen bekijken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Alt</key><key>Enter</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Sluiten</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>W</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Knippen</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>X</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Kopiëren</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>C</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Plakken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>V</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Een bestand of map in een archief hernoemen</p></td>
      <td><p><key>F2</key></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Alles selecteren</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>A</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Selectie opheffen</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Shift</key><key>Ctrl</key><key>A</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Zoeken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>F</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Bestanden of mappen uit een archief verwijderen</p></td>
      <td><p><key>Delete</key></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>De boomstructuur van de mappen in de zijbalk weergeven</p></td>
      <td><p><key>F9</key></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>De inhoud van een archief als bestandenlijst bekijken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>1</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>De inhoud van een archief als mappenstructuur bekijken</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>2</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>De bewerking stoppen</p></td>
      <td><p><key>Esc</key></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Vernieuwen</p></td>
      <td><p><keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>R</key></keyseq></p></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><p>Hulp weergeven</p></td>
      <td><p><key>F1</key></p></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

